/90/4025/dfasyhut2w/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr679/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="679" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr679"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfaso5oiq9/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr></table></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr680/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="680" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr680"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfast73gmx/"></a>&#160;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr681/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="681" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr681"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas7fu2l7/"></a>Основные средства&#160;____________________________________________________________<br>_____________________________________________________________________________<br>_____________________________________________________________________________</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr682/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="682" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr682"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasbwh94e/"></a>Местонахождение&#160;____________________________________________________________<br>_____________________________________________________________________________</p><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr683/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="683" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr683"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasocdlio/"></a>РАСПИСКА</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr684/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="684" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr684"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas31k8dz/"></a>К началу проведения инвентаризации все расходные и приходные документы на основные средства сданы в бухгалтерию и все основные средства, поступившие на мою (нашу) ответственность, оприходованы, а выбывшие списаны в расход.</p><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="100%"><tr valign="top"><td colspan="5"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr685/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="685" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr685"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas5mqnvk/"></a>Лицо(а), ответственное(ые) за сохранность основных средств:</p></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td class="bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr686/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="686" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr686"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasmwhney/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr687/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="687" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr687"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasp5rl75/"></a>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr688/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="688" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr688"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfaselxk37/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr689/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="689" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr689"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas7eapo4/"></a>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr690/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="690" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr690"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasdccg6k/"></a>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&