><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3212/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3212" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3212"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasyi3qbd/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3213/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3213" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3213"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas5ivgo5/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3214/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3214" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3214"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasga450y/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3215/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3215" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3215"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasqrdhig/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td colspan="3" class="bdAll"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3216/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3216" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3216"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasza36s0/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3217/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3217" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3217"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas860gx8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3218/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3218" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3218"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas6m17cp/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3219/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3219" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3219"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasssxixg/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td colspan="4" align="right"><p class="align-right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3220/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3220" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3220"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasyncgn9/"></a>Дата окончания инвентаризации</p></td><td colspan="3" class="bdAll"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3221/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3221" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3221"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasnl7tym/"></a>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</p></td></tr></table></div></div></div><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3222/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3222" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3222"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasf3p12q/"></a>&#160;<br>РАСПИСКА</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3223/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3223" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3223"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas2feeii/"></a>К началу проведения инвентаризации все расходные и приходные документы на товарно-материальные ценности сданы в бухгалтерию и все товарно-материальные ценности, поступившие на мою (нашу) ответственность, оприходованы, а выбывшие в расход.</p><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="100%"><tr valign="top"><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3224/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3224" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3224"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfastmg2ks/"></a>Материально-ответственное(ые) лицо (а):</p></td><td class="bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3225/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3225" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3225"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas40bc4k/"></a>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3226/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3226" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3226"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasgxx8pw/"></a>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3227/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3227" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3227"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasumnbey/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3228/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3228" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3228"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasa6ez1y/"></a>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3229/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3229" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3229"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasevah5s/"></a>&#160;</p></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3230/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3230" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3230"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas505fs0/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td align="center" class="bdTop"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3231/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3231" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3231"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasqkndlw/"></a>(должность)</p></td><td align="center"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3232/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3232" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3232"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas4th8f8/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td align="center" class="bdTop"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3233/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3233" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3233"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas4gex2g/"></a>(подпись)</p></td><td align="center"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3234/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3234" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3234"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasgd19g1/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td align="center" class="bdTop"><p class="align-center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3235/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3235" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3235"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfaspi2w2v/"></a>(расшифровка подписи)</p></td></tr></table></div></div></div><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3236/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3236" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3236"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasb20s0h/"></a>&#160;<br>При инвентаризации установлено следующее:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3237/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3237" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3237"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasi3gaan/"></a>1) наличных денег_______________________сум.;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;3) ценных бумаг ____________сум;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3238/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3238" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3238"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasxu62pg/"></a>2) почтовых марок ____________________сум.;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;4) ________________________сум;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3239/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3239" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3239"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasa8gywc/"></a>Итого фактическое наличие&#160;_____________________________сум;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3240/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3240" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3240"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfass5g9qr/"></a>_____________________________________________________________________________<br>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;(подпись)<br>_____________________________________________________________________________<br>_____________________________________________________________________________</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3241/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3241" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3241"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas6fx37x/"></a>По учетным данным _____________________________сум.;</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3242/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3242" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3242"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasbcvtvv/"></a>Результаты инвентаризации: излишек сум.; недостача ___________________________ сум.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3243/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3243" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3243"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas4r1xoy/"></a>Последние номера кассовых ордеров: приходного № __________; расходного №_________</p><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="100%"><tr valign="top"><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3244/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3244" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3244"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasyyh3nc/"></a>Председатель комиссии:</p></td><td class="bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3245/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3245" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3245"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfas5xhv55/"></a>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3246/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3246" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3246"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfassq1wn9/"></a>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</p></td><td class="bdBottom"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3247/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3247" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3247"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/dfasav943k/"></a>&#160;</p></td><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4025/bssPhr3248/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3248" data-dwh-source-type